<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Luminary Meridian. Cloud & AI Strategy Consulting</title>
<meta name="description" content="Luminary Meridian is a US-based Cloud and AI strategy consulting firm. Nigeria. West Africa. Global Reach.">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="data:image/png;base64,">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,400;0,9..144,500;0,9..144,600;1,9..144,400;1,9..144,500&family=Hanken+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --orange:#BC6A3A; --blue:#7C7E5B; --dk-orange:#9C5630; --dk-blue:#63654A;
  --lt-orange:rgba(188,106,58,0.10); --lt-blue:rgba(124,126,91,0.12);
  --bronze:#A8854E; --espresso:#3A322A;
  --bg:#F4EEE2; --bg2:#EBE2D2; --surface:#FBF7EF;
  --border:rgba(45,38,30,0.14); --text:#26201A;
  --muted:rgba(38,32,26,0.58); --faint:rgba(38,32,26,0.30);
  --font-display:'Fraunces',serif; --font-sans:'Hanken Grotesk',sans-serif; --font-mono:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;
  --shadow:0 18px 50px rgba(78,54,30,0.10);
}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-family:var(--font-sans);overflow-x:hidden;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;line-height:1.5;cursor:none}
::selection{background:rgba(188,106,58,0.18)}
nav{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;padding:22px 60px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;background:rgba(244,238,226,0.82);backdrop-filter:blur(18px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);transition:padding .3s}
.nav-logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:13px;text-decoration:none}
.nav-logo-mark{height:38px;width:auto;display:block}
.nav-logo-text{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:500;font-size:17px;letter-spacing:.01em;color:var(--text);line-height:1.1}
.nav-logo-sub{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:8px;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-top:2px}
.nav-links{display:flex;gap:34px;list-style:none;align-items:center}
.nav-links a{text-decoration:none;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);transition:color .2s;position:relative}
.nav-links a::after{content:'';position:absolute;bottom:-5px;left:0;right:0;height:1px;background:var(--orange);transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:center;transition:transform .25s}
.nav-links a:hover{color:var(--text)}
.nav-links a:hover::after{transform:scaleX(1)}
.nav-cta{background:var(--orange)!important;color:#FBF7EF!important;padding:11px 24px;border-radius:2px;font-size:11px!important;font-weight:600!important;letter-spacing:.08em;transition:background .25s,transform .25s!important}
.nav-cta:hover{background:var(--dk-orange)!important;transform:translateY(-1px)}
.nav-cta::after{display:none!important}
#hero{min-height:100vh;position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;overflow:hidden;padding:150px 60px 90px}
.hero-bg{position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 55% at 80% 25%,rgba(188,106,58,.10) 0%,transparent 60%),radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 60% at 12% 78%,rgba(124,126,91,.10) 0%,transparent 60%)}
.hero-grid{position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(45,38,30,.035) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(45,38,30,.035) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:88px 88px;mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse 90% 80% at 30% 40%,#000 0%,transparent 75%)}
.orb{position:absolute;border-radius:50%;filter:blur(90px);pointer-events:none;opacity:.7}
.orb1{width:380px;height:380px;background:rgba(188,106,58,.12);top:-80px;right:-40px}
.orb2{width:300px;height:300px;background:rgba(124,126,91,.12);bottom:-60px;left:-70px}
.hero-content{position:relative;z-index:2;max-width:840px}
.hero-eyebrow{display:block;margin-bottom:30px;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.28em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dk-orange);opacity:0;animation:fadeUp .8s ease forwards .2s}
.hero-headline{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(52px,7.2vw,92px);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin-bottom:30px;opacity:0;animation:fadeUp .9s ease forwards .4s}
.hero-headline .line2{color:var(--orange)}
.hero-headline .line3{font-style:italic;font-weight:400;color:var(--blue)}
.hero-sub{font-size:18px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;max-width:520px;margin-bottom:46px;opacity:0;animation:fadeUp .9s ease forwards .6s}
.hero-actions{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;opacity:0;animation:fadeUp .9s ease forwards .8s}
.btn-primary{background:var(--orange);color:#FBF7EF;padding:16px 32px;border-radius:2px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;transition:background .25s,transform .25s,box-shadow .25s;border:none}
.btn-primary:hover{background:var(--dk-orange);transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 14px 34px rgba(156,86,48,.22)}
.btn-primary .arrow{transition:transform .2s}
.btn-primary:hover .arrow{transform:translateX(4px)}
.btn-secondary{background:transparent;color:var(--text);padding:16px 32px;border-radius:2px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid var(--border);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;transition:border-color .25s,transform .25s,background .25s}
.btn-secondary:hover{border-color:var(--orange);background:rgba(188,106,58,.05);transform:translateY(-2px)}
.hero-stats{position:absolute;right:60px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0;z-index:2;opacity:0;animation:fadeLeft 1s ease forwards 1s}
.stat-card{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-top:none;padding:20px 26px;min-width:212px;transition:transform .3s}
.stat-card:first-child{border-top:1px solid var(--border)}
.stat-card:hover{transform:translateX(-6px)}
.stat-num{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:38px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;margin-bottom:5px;color:var(--text)}
.stat-card:nth-child(odd) .stat-num{color:var(--orange)}
.stat-card:nth-child(even) .stat-num{color:var(--blue)}
.stat-desc{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:9px;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;line-height:1.5}
section{position:relative;z-index:1;padding:130px 60px}
.section-label{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dk-orange);margin-bottom:18px}
.section-title{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(36px,4.6vw,60px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.015em;margin-bottom:22px;color:var(--text)}
.section-sub{font-size:17px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:580px;margin-bottom:66px}
#services{background:var(--bg2)}
.services-header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;margin-bottom:60px;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:24px}
.services-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--border)}
.service-card{background:var(--surface);padding:50px 46px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;transition:background .3s,transform .3s}
.service-card::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:2px;background:var(--orange);transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:left;transition:transform .45s ease}
.service-card:nth-child(even)::before{background:var(--blue)}
.service-card:hover::before{transform:scaleX(1)}
.service-card:hover{background:#FFFDF8}
.service-title{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:25px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.005em;margin-bottom:14px;line-height:1.18}
.service-card:nth-child(odd) .service-title{color:var(--orange)}
.service-card:nth-child(even) .service-title{color:var(--blue)}
.service-desc{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:28px}
.service-tags{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}
.s-tag{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:6px 11px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--lt-orange);color:var(--dk-orange);border:1px solid rgba(188,106,58,.18)}
.service-card:nth-child(even) .s-tag{background:var(--lt-blue);color:var(--dk-blue);border-color:rgba(124,126,91,.22)}
#focus{background:var(--bg)}
.focus-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--border)}
.focus-card{padding:38px 34px;background:var(--surface);position:relative;overflow:hidden;transition:background .3s,transform .3s}
.focus-card:hover{background:#FFFDF8;transform:translateY(-3px)}
.focus-card::after{content:'';position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;height:2px;transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:left;transition:transform .4s}
.focus-card:nth-child(odd)::after{background:var(--orange)}
.focus-card:nth-child(even)::after{background:var(--blue)}
.focus-card:hover::after{transform:scaleX(1)}
.focus-title{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:19px;font-weight:500;margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.2}
.focus-card:nth-child(odd) .focus-title{color:var(--orange)}
.focus-card:nth-child(even) .focus-title{color:var(--blue)}
.focus-desc{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7}
.focus-badge{display:inline-block;margin-top:14px;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:5px 11px;background:var(--lt-orange);color:var(--dk-orange);border-radius:2px}
#hyperscalers{background:var(--bg2)}
.hyper-intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:80px;margin-bottom:60px;align-items:center}
.independence-box{background:var(--lt-orange);border:1px solid rgba(188,106,58,.22);border-left:3px solid var(--orange);padding:30px 34px;border-radius:2px}
.independence-box p{font-size:15px;color:var(--text);line-height:1.75;font-style:italic;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:400}
.independence-box strong{color:var(--dk-orange);font-weight:600}
.hyper-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--border)}
.hyper-card{background:var(--surface);padding:34px 30px;position:relative;transition:background .3s,transform .3s}
.hyper-card:hover{background:#FFFDF8;transform:translateY(-3px)}
.hyper-abbr{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:36px;font-weight:500;line-height:1;margin-bottom:7px}
.hyper-name{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:9px;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:22px;padding-bottom:18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.hyper-card:nth-child(1){border-top:2px solid var(--orange)}
.hyper-card:nth-child(1) .hyper-abbr{color:var(--orange)}
.hyper-card:nth-child(2){border-top:2px solid var(--blue)}
.hyper-card:nth-child(2) .hyper-abbr{color:var(--blue)}
.hyper-card:nth-child(3){border-top:2px solid var(--bronze)}
.hyper-card:nth-child(3) .hyper-abbr{color:var(--bronze)}
.hyper-card:nth-child(4){border-top:2px solid var(--espresso)}
.hyper-card:nth-child(4) .hyper-abbr{color:var(--espresso)}
.hyper-pts{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px}
.hyper-pts li{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);padding-left:15px;position:relative;line-height:1.45}
.hyper-pts li::before{content:'›';position:absolute;left:0;color:var(--orange);font-weight:700}
.hyper-card:nth-child(2) .hyper-pts li::before{color:var(--blue)}
.hyper-card:nth-child(3) .hyper-pts li::before{color:var(--bronze)}
.hyper-card:nth-child(4) .hyper-pts li::before{color:var(--espresso)}
#team{background:var(--bg)}
#why{background:var(--bg2);overflow:hidden}
.why-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:80px;align-items:center}
.why-left .big-stat{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:120px;font-weight:400;line-height:.9;color:var(--orange);letter-spacing:-.04em;margin-bottom:14px}
.why-left .big-label{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:42px}
.differentiators{display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.diff-item{padding:22px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:flex-start;transition:padding-left .3s}
.diff-item:first-child{border-top:1px solid var(--border)}
.diff-item:hover{padding-left:8px}
.diff-dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;margin-top:8px;flex-shrink:0}
.diff-item:nth-child(odd) .diff-dot{background:var(--orange)}
.diff-item:nth-child(even) .diff-dot{background:var(--blue)}
.diff-title{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:500;font-size:17px;margin-bottom:5px;color:var(--text)}
.diff-desc{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65}
#contact{background:var(--bg);text-align:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.contact-bg{position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 55% at 50% 45%,rgba(188,106,58,.09) 0%,transparent 62%),radial-gradient(ellipse 55% 45% at 22% 82%,rgba(124,126,91,.08) 0%,transparent 62%)}
.contact-inner{position:relative;z-index:2;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto}
.contact-headline{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(42px,5.6vw,74px);line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin-bottom:24px;color:var(--text)}
.contact-headline em{font-style:italic;font-weight:400;color:var(--orange)}
.contact-sub{font-size:17px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:46px}
.contact-actions{display:flex;gap:14px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:62px}
.contact-info{display:flex;gap:54px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
.contact-detail{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}
.contact-detail-label{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}
.contact-detail-value{font-size:14px;font-weight:500;color:var(--text)}
footer{background:var(--bg2);padding:42px 60px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border-top:1px solid var(--border);flex-wrap:wrap;gap:20px}
.footer-brand{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:500;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.01em;color:var(--text)}
.footer-tagline{font-family:var(--font-display);font-style:italic;font-size:15px;color:var(--orange)}
.footer-geo{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase}
.section-divider{width:100%;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,var(--border),transparent)}
.reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px);transition:opacity .7s ease,transform .7s ease}
.reveal.visible{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}
@keyframes fadeUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}
@keyframes fadeLeft{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(-50%) translateX(24px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(-50%) translateX(0)}}
@media(max-width:900px){nav{padding:16px 24px}.nav-links{display:none}section{padding:84px 24px}#hero{padding:120px 24px 64px}.hero-stats{display:none}.services-grid,.focus-grid,.hyper-grid,.case-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.why-layout,.hyper-intro{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:44px}.why-left .big-stat{font-size:84px}footer{padding:32px 24px}.cursor,.cursor-ring{display:none}body{cursor:auto}}
#case-studies{background:var(--bg)}
.case-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--border)}
.case-card{background:var(--surface);padding:52px 48px;position:relative;transition:background .3s}
.case-card:hover{background:#FFFDF8}
.case-eyebrow{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dk-orange);margin-bottom:24px}
.case-title{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:500;font-size:27px;line-height:1.2;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:18px}
.case-body{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.78;margin-bottom:32px}
.case-result{border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-top:24px}
.case-metric{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:25px;font-weight:500;font-style:italic;color:var(--orange);line-height:1.1;margin-bottom:7px}
.case-metric-label{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.55}
a,button{cursor:none}
.cursor{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;width:11px;height:11px;background:var(--orange);border-radius:50%;pointer-events:none;z-index:9999;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);transition:width .2s,height .2s,background .2s}
.cursor-ring{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;width:34px;height:34px;border:1px solid rgba(188,106,58,.45);border-radius:50%;pointer-events:none;z-index:9998;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);transition:width .3s,height .3s,border-color .3s}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="cursor" id="cursor"></div>
<div class="cursor-ring" id="cursorRing"></div>

<nav>
  <a href="#hero" class="nav-logo">
    <img class="nav-logo-mark" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Luminary Meridian logo">
    <div>
      <div class="nav-logo-text">Luminary Meridian</div>
      <div class="nav-logo-sub">Cloud &amp; AI Strategy</div>
    </div>
  </a>
  <ul class="nav-links">
    <li><a href="#services">Services</a></li>
    <li><a href="#fsi">FSI</a></li><li><a href="#focus">Focus Areas</a></li>
    <li><a href="#hyperscalers">Hyperscalers</a></li>
    <li><a href="#team">Team</a></li>
    <li><a href="#why">Why LM</a></li>
    <li><a href="#case-studies">Case Studies</a></li>
    <li><a href="#contact" class="nav-cta">Contact Us</a></li>
  </ul>
</nav>

<section id="hero">
  <div class="hero-bg"></div>
  <div class="hero-grid"></div>
  <div class="orb orb1"></div>
  <div class="orb orb2"></div>
  <div class="hero-content">
    <div class="hero-eyebrow">Nigeria &nbsp;·&nbsp; West Africa &nbsp;·&nbsp; Global Reach</div>
    <h1 class="hero-headline">
      Africa's AI<br>
      <span class="line2">moment is now.</span><br>
      <span class="line3">We're in it.</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">The independent Cloud and AI strategy advisory firm Africa's technology ecosystem has been missing. Deep technologists. Frontier AI expertise. Zero vendor conflicts.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="#contact" class="btn-primary">Start a Conversation <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
      <a href="#services" class="btn-secondary">Our Services ↓</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-stats">
    <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-num">$3.28B</div><div class="stat-desc">Nigeria cloud market<br>projected by 2030</div></div>
    <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-num">25.98%</div><div class="stat-desc">Annual cloud market<br>growth CAGR</div></div>
    <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-num">$1B+</div><div class="stat-desc">Data centre investment<br>underway now</div></div>
    <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-num">0</div><div class="stat-desc">Independent Cloud &amp; AI<br>advisory firms in Nigeria</div></div>
  </div>

</section>

<div class="section-divider"></div>

<section id="services">
  <div class="services-header">
    <div>
      <div class="section-label">What We Do</div>
      <h2 class="section-title reveal">Six Service Lines.<br>One Mission.</h2>
      <p class="section-sub reveal">Advisory-led. Platform-agnostic. Outcome-obsessed. We design strategy, architect solutions, and govern implementation.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="services-grid reveal">
    <div class="service-card">
      <h3 class="service-title">Cloud &amp; AI Strategy Advisory</h3>
      <p class="service-desc">We work with C-suite leaders and government ministries to design multi-year Cloud and AI transformation roadmaps. commercially rigorous, politically astute, and built for Africa's infrastructure reality.</p>
      <div class="service-tags"><span class="s-tag">AI Readiness</span><span class="s-tag">Cloud Roadmaps</span><span class="s-tag">National AI Strategy</span><span class="s-tag">Multi-cloud</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="service-card">
      <h3 class="service-title">AI Infrastructure &amp; Data Centre Advisory</h3>
      <p class="service-desc">Nigeria is investing $1B in data centres. We advise operators, investors, and government on AI-optimised infrastructure design. GPU strategy, hybrid cloud, power resilience, and edge computing.</p>
      <div class="service-tags"><span class="s-tag">GPU Infrastructure</span><span class="s-tag">Edge Computing</span><span class="s-tag">Hybrid Cloud</span><span class="s-tag">Data Centre ROI</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="service-card">
      <h3 class="service-title">Hyperscaler Partnership &amp; Procurement</h3>
      <p class="service-desc">Most Nigerian enterprises cannot effectively negotiate with AWS, Google Cloud, or Azure. We bridge that gap as a fully independent advisor. zero vendor fees, zero conflicts, always in your corner.</p>
      <div class="service-tags"><span class="s-tag">AWS Advisory</span><span class="s-tag">GCP Strategy</span><span class="s-tag">FinOps</span><span class="s-tag">Sovereign Cloud</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="service-card">
      <h3 class="service-title">Train the Trainers</h3>
      <p class="service-desc">Nigeria's technology talent programmes are only as good as the people delivering them. We train the trainers powering national programmes. starting with AI infrastructure. ensuring the people teaching Nigeria's next generation are always at the frontier, not behind it.</p>
      <div class="service-tags"><span class="s-tag">AI Infrastructure</span><span class="s-tag">Cohort Design</span><span class="s-tag">Certification</span><span class="s-tag">Hands-on Labs</span></div>
    </div>
